\pard\b\fs20 Kasei Vallis\b0\par
\fs16\par
This area lies near the Valles Marineris and was once the largest river valley on Mars. In primeval times, enormous masses of water flowed through here and formed many canyons.\par
Today this area shows volcanic activity again, and the canyon has filled with lava. But for the bravest researchers of the team, that doesn't seem to be a problem...\par
